  ('f38e32c5f93288fc9942da112eb6b943fe864e0dfa8510f65bee80f77d165b88', 'ur-roman', 'Wash the private parts and remove any impurity from the body.', 'sharamgaah dhoyein aur jism se har najasat door karein.'),
