  ('350d2f829dafb246cee15925c8a4d731c38d9cac37bf2b80209777117c52a3fa', 'ur', 'Sit for the qa’dah. Recite At-tahiyyat: “At-tahiyyatu lillahi was-salawatu wat-tayyibat, as-salamu ‘alaika ayyuhan-nabiyyu wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuh, as-salamu ‘alaina wa ‘ala ‘ibadillahis-salihin, ash-hadu an la ilaha illallah, wa ash-hadu anna Muhammadan ‘abduhu wa rasuluh.” At “la ilaha” raise the index finger and lower it at “illallah”.', 'قعدے کے لیے بیٹھیں۔ التحیات پڑھیں: “At-tahiyyatu lillahi was-salawatu wat-tayyibat, as-salamu ‘alaika ayyuhan-nabiyyu wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuh, as-salamu ‘alaina wa ‘ala ‘ibadillahis-salihin, ash-hadu an la ilaha illallah, wa ash-hadu anna Muhammadan ‘abduhu wa rasuluh.” “la ilaha” پر شہادت کی انگلی اٹھائیں اور “illallah” پر گرا دیں۔'),
  ('ab817c0ec9d14f5a2c02ad57f18a560e834d2dd6caeedd57fc43e791e243fcaf', 'ur-roman', 'Sit for the qa’dah. Recite At-tahiyyat: “At-tahiyyatu lillahi was-salawatu wat-tayyibat, as-salamu ‘alaika ayyuhan-nabiyyu wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuh, as-salamu ‘alaina wa ‘ala ‘ibadillahis-salihin, ash-hadu an la ilaha illallah, wa ash-hadu anna Muhammadan ‘abduhu wa rasuluh.” At “la ilaha” raise the index finger and lower it at “illallah”.', 'qaade ke liye baithein. At-tahiyyat padhein: “At-tahiyyatu lillahi was-salawatu wat-tayyibat, as-salamu ‘alaika ayyuhan-nabiyyu wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuh, as-salamu ‘alaina wa ‘ala ‘ibadillahis-salihin, ash-hadu an la ilaha illallah, wa ash-hadu anna Muhammadan ‘abduhu wa rasuluh.” “la ilaha” par shahadat ki ungli uthayein aur “illallah” par gira dein.'),
  ('03c96a4944595969ebd5ecd869380a549e29be21cc7f6a41cad3a5a9caedd85c', 'ur', 'Durood-e-Ibrahim', 'درودِ ابراہیمی'),
