  ('a9ead3d2d6b00d2666f9bed0a1514d767d786673d458257e6bc5d7ad388598f3', 'ur', 'Then recite Dua-e-Masura: “Allahumma inni zalamtu nafsi zulman kathira, wa la yaghfirudh-dhunuba illa anta, faghfir li maghfiratam min ‘indika warhamni, innaka antal-Ghafurur-Rahim.”', 'پھر دعائے ماثورہ پڑھیں: “Allahumma inni zalamtu nafsi zulman kathira, wa la yaghfirudh-dhunuba illa anta, faghfir li maghfiratam min ‘indika warhamni, innaka antal-Ghafurur-Rahim.”'),
  ('b77ec1e51a0ee335de0f054f9b11a97e30eaf26019990ec13b0b93dc42b8bec4', 'ur-roman', 'Then recite Dua-e-Masura: “Allahumma inni zalamtu nafsi zulman kathira, wa la yaghfirudh-dhunuba illa anta, faghfir li maghfiratam min ‘indika warhamni, innaka antal-Ghafurur-Rahim.”', 'phir Dua-e-Masura padhein: “Allahumma inni zalamtu nafsi zulman kathira, wa la yaghfirudh-dhunuba illa anta, faghfir li maghfiratam min ‘indika warhamni, innaka antal-Ghafurur-Rahim.”'),
